From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nds-ports <nds-ports@localhost>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Speed up the drawers

The C versions of the assembly drawers kept everything in globals and
counted every pixel for a debugging feature. They keep their state in
registers now, the wall drawer does two columns at a time with a halfword
per row, and the pixel counter is gone. Drawers given no pixels to draw
draw none.
---
 Engine/src/draw.c   | 190 ++++++++++++++++----------------------------
 Engine/src/draw.h   |   1 -
 Engine/src/engine.c |   3 -
 3 files changed, 70 insertions(+), 124 deletions(-)

